      "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate opened 2023 with gross claims outstanding of GBP 500.0m. During 2023 there was an adverse reassessment of prior-year claims (reported as a net deficit of GBP 2.0m), and the directors note reserve deteriorations driven principally by increased provisions for potential exposures arising from the Ukraine War; prior-year weather catastrophes (Hurricane Ian and Winter Storm Elliot) also contributed to higher prior-year losses. While benign attritional experience in 2023 produced favourable outcomes in several classes, the overall prior-year movement is described as a small deterioration. No single quantified gross prior-year movement (insurance liabilities gross figure) was explicitly stated in the annual accounts notes, so an aggregate gross prior-year movement could not be calculated from the disclosed tables.",
